---
Fix calloc/malloc calls in the audio-critical path.

Memory allocation in the audio callback causes priority inversion and
potential glitches. Pre-allocate all buffers at init time.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] No malloc/calloc/realloc/free calls in engine_process() or anything it calls
- [ ] Effects buffers pre-allocated at engine init
- [ ] Synth voice buffers pre-allocated at engine init
- [ ] Verified with grep or static analysis that audio path is allocation-free

## Test Plan
- [ ] grep -r "malloc\|calloc\|realloc\|free" in audio path functions
- [ ] Run engine_render_test under ASan, verify no allocations during process
- [ ] Play complex pattern (all tracks active, effects on), verify no glitches
